atom	astonishing	this deservedly provokes astonishment
atom	wicked_flourish	wickedness reigns and flourishes
atom	virtue_punished	virtue lacks its reward, is trampled under the feet of the wicked, and suffers punishment in the place of crime
atom	god_all	the rule is that of a God who knows all things and can do all things, but wills only the good
atom	beyond_wonder	this cannot be sufficiently wondered at nor sufficiently lamented
